OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian in his 40s has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car on a major A-road
OL,8,Fthat serves Bristol Airport.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to a collision involving a
OL,12,Fpedestrian and a white Vauxhall Astra
OL,13,Fon the A38 in Brent Knoll at 05:20 BST.
OL,15,FPolice said the pedestrian died at the
OL,16,Fscene and his family have been
OL,17,Finformed.
OL,19,FThe A38 was closed between the Fox and
OL,20,FGoose Pub and the B3140 roundabout
OL,21,Fearlier and has since reopened.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
